Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Change base/shell/explorer/taskswnd.cpp to integrate the external Python
 taskbar bridge. The patch adds a timer-driven sync that reads
 /tmp/reactos-taskbar-windows.json, maintains a parallel set of external
 TASK_ITEM entries keyed by window ID, and renders them alongside native
 Windows tasks in the ReactOS Explorer taskbar. It also writes
 focus/right-click actions to /tmp/reactos-taskbar-control.json so the bridge
 can raise or activate the corresponding host X11 windows. Native Wine window
 icons are skipped for external tasks because the host bridge supplies its own
 imagery.
Last-Modified: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 19:30:09 +0300

